     level; these can never be converted."


The other praying spoiler is also in error about unaligned altars:
     "Sacrificing at an alter of Moloch is very bad. You gain 3 anger,
     lose 5 alignment, lose 2 wisdom, and lose 5 luck, and get a
     negative effect." - http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/pray.html#p7

Sacrificing at an altar of Moloch *outside Gehennom* has none of these=20
negative consequences - if the conversion succeeds. Sacrificing on a=20
non-Gehennom altar of Moloch with negative alignment (ie, a sure failed=20
conversion) seems to trigger just what the spoiler says though.

